{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24067","headline":"嬾放二首呈刘梦得吴方之 二 · 白居易","name":"嬾放二首呈刘梦得吴方之 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝怜一牀日，暮爱一炉火。\n牀暖日高眠，炉温夜深坐。\n雀罗门嬾出，鹤发头慵裹。\n除却刘与吴，何人来问我。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24067.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24067","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}